### Especialidade
POST http://localhost:8080/api/especialidades
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Cardiologia", "descricao": "Coração e sistema circulatório" }

### Paciente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pacientes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nomeCompleto": "Maria Souza", "cpf": "123.456.789-00", "dataNascimento": "1990-05-20",
  "telefone": "(11) 99999-0000", "email": "maria@email.com" }

### Medico (use o id da especialidade criada acima)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medicos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nomeCompleto": "Dr. João Lima", "crm": "CRM-SP 123456", "especialidadeId": 1,
  "telefone": "(11) 98888-0000", "email": "joao@medicenter.com" }

### Consulta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/consultas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pacienteId": 1, "medicoId": 1,
  "dataHoraInicio": "2026-10-20T14:00:00", "dataHoraFim": "2026-10-20T14:30:00",
  "motivo": "Check-up" }

### Sobreposição de horário: deve dar 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/consultas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pacienteId": 1, "medicoId": 1,
  "dataHoraInicio": "2026-10-20T14:15:00", "dataHoraFim": "2026-10-20T14:45:00" }

### Cancelar consulta
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/consultas/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CANCELADA" }

### Listagens
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pacientes

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/medicos

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/consultas
